{"id":"profundidad","lemma":"profundidad","pos":"noun","rank":3136,"glosses":["depth"],"ipa":"/pɾofundiˈdad/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"profundidades"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/6/68/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-profundidad.wav","examples":[{"text":"¿Conoces la profundidad del agua?","en":"Do you know how deep the water is?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/605075","words":[{"g":"to know","l":"conocer"},{"g":"the / her"},null,{"g":"of the"},{"g":"water"}]},{"text":"¿Cuál es la profundidad del agujero?","en":"How deep is the hole?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/45854","words":[{"g":"which one, what, which"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"the / her"},null,{"g":"of the"},{"g":"hole"}]},{"text":"Lo estudié en profundidad.","en":"I studied it thoroughly.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/607955","words":[{"g":"it / him"},{"g":"to study","l":"estudiar"},{"g":"in / on"},null]},{"text":"Nosotros medimos la profundidad del río.","en":"We measured the depth of the river.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/599953","words":[{"g":"we"},{"g":"to measure","l":"medir"},{"g":"the / her"},null,{"g":"of the"},{"g":"river"}]},{"text":"El río tiene cinco pies de profundidad.","en":"The river is five feet deep.","words":[{"g":"the"},{"g":"river"},{"g":"to have","l":"tener"},{"g":"a five"},{"g":"foot","l":"pie"},{"g":"of / from"},null]}]}